The successful execution of the Jenkins CI/CD pipeline is demonstrated using screenshots captured during the complete deployment process from code push to application deployment.

The pipeline includes source code checkout, dependency installation, testing, static code analysis, Docker image creation, Docker Hub push, deployment, and verification.

